    }
   ],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "24e8ee308825",
     "text": "Source: official Walt Disney World attraction pages, accessed October 26, 2026. See every EPCOT ride in the ",
     "marks": []
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "97a0efdccd1f",
     "text": "EPCOT all-heights ride finder",
     "marks": [
      "c2611801b736"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "c169b3d87caf",
     "text": ", or the ",
     "marks": []
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "576a4fdc14d8",
     "text": "44-inch EPCOT list",
     "marks": [
      "e213f0dcfb6a"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "813e4627495b",
     "text": ".",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "d5d9cf2f9e29",
   "style": "h2",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "6205e2dc9506",
     "text": "What's Different at EPCOT Right Now",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "0791f4e38f50",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "fe9e816216c8",
     "text": "Soarin' Across America has replaced Soarin' Around the World for now.",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "e0e08d4574af",
     "text": " Disney's Soarin' Around the World page says that film is currently unavailable and points guests to Soarin' Across America, a limited-time film tied to the country's 250th birthday. Same ride system, same 40-inch minimum.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ],
   "listItem": "bullet",
   "level": 1
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "3cea67f38ae4",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "ca14b9aa8d60",
     "text": "Living with the Land shows as closed November 27 through December 30, 2026",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "ca27aa26eb44",
     "text": " on Disney's official schedule (checked October 26, 2026). It is listed as operating before and after those dates. If you visit during the holidays, plan around it.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ],
   "listItem": "bullet",
   "level": 1
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "0c9965651cd8",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "36de6ea3d70f",
     "text": "DuckTales World Showcase Adventure",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "9e99a43981f0",
     "text": " — Disney's page says it is currently under refurbishment and may be available in a limited format.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ],
   "listItem": "bullet",
   "level": 1
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "13f86c54101a",
   "style": "h2",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "f952249ec4b4",
     "text": "Best EPCOT Rides for Kids Under 40 Inches",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "0646874dfce9",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "c4a3d00d2b1a",
     "text": "Shorter kids can still fill a day at EPCOT. Start here:",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "383b61599377",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "df5997503eae",
     "text": "Frozen Ever After",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "039ae198f66b",
     "text": " — a slow-moving boat ride through Arendelle with Anna, Elsa and Olaf. Any height. Disney notes backward and forward plunges down short waterfalls, and you may get wet, so give nervous riders a heads-up.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ],
   "listItem": "bullet",
   "level": 1
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "d5106117ff22",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "817ad11af81a",
     "text": "Remy's Ratatouille Adventure",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "c12d5331fb50",
     "text": " — a ride that makes you feel shrunk down to Chef Remy's size in Gusteau's restaurant. Any height, and a great pick for Pixar fans.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ],
   "listItem": "bullet",
   "level": 1
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "73869621bc9c",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "d448dac0e00e",
     "text": "The Seas with Nemo & Friends",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "2c6548bdaa38",
     "text": " — a slow \"clamobile\" ride, then a huge aquarium with sea turtles, rays and sharks. Disney also lists a free Dory scavenger hunt here.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ],
   "listItem": "bullet",
   "level": 1
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "06f8d25fe0d0",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "e4f52bdfe334",
     "text": "Turtle Talk with Crush",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "31f9eca12f48",
     "text": " — a live, improvised chat with Crush the sea turtle. Kids may get to ask him a question, and it's different every time.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ],
   "listItem": "bullet",
   "level": 1
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "a18447febe0b",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "21fcb3030e1f",
     "text": "Journey Into Imagination with Figment",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "1f11cdc8091b",
     "text": " — a silly ride through the five senses, which leads into ",
     "marks": []
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "deebaa6e69f0",
     "text": "ImageWorks",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "4e399051a617",
     "text": ", an indoor play space where kids can jump on musical \"Stepping Tones\" and conduct an orchestra by waving their arms.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ],
   "listItem": "bullet",
   "level": 1
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "f795e026588d",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "fb58b984361b",
     "text": "Spaceship Earth",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "7cd54e5690d8",
     "text": " — a 16-minute seated ride inside the giant sphere, which makes it a good rest stop.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ],
   "listItem": "bullet",
   "level": 1
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "8366c76f4a03",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "6295108daf6f",
     "text": "Gran Fiesta Tour",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "0995710ff40a",
     "text": " — a gentle boat ride with Donald Duck inside the Mexico pavilion.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ],
   "listItem": "bullet",
   "level": 1
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "c04d6fbfc1e2",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [
    {
     "_type": "link",
     "_key": "d7e0cfa176d0",
     "href": "/rides/for/epcot-calm-under-40/"
    }
   ],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "7916a9debf35",
     "text": "For sensitive riders, the ride finder's ",
     "marks": []
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "f18ba36813a7",
     "text": "calm EPCOT picks under 40 inches",
     "marks": [
      "d7e0cfa176d0"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "ab341283a9ad",
     "text": " skips anything with big drops or spinning.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "e7abcb27095c",
   "style": "h2",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "594d51f9cfc0",
     "text": "Where Can Kids Play at EPCOT?",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "57969e0e4f87",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "f159d7f91d4b",
     "text": "Families often search for an EPCOT playground. The best hands-on spots on Disney's current attraction list are:",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "fa00a8266431",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "af6feb38b917",
     "text": "Journey of Water Inspired by Moana",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "d1917fc8b2d1",
     "text": " — an outdoor exploration trail where kids can play with water. Any height. Disney says you can choose to get wet or take the dry path.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ],
   "listItem": "bullet",
   "level": 1
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "3daab1c04620",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "6eea76b50d36",
     "text": "ImageWorks",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "4a5ace0f2d2c",
     "text": " — the indoor sensory play area after Figment.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ],
   "listItem": "bullet",
   "level": 1
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "786db7926bbe",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "a0baa8167acb",
     "text": "Kidcot Fun Stops",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "c836771d25d3",
     "text": " — Disney lists Kidcot Fun Stops at EPCOT; check the My Disney Experience app for current locations.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ],
   "listItem": "bullet",
   "level": 1
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "7da49c70eb91",
   "style": "h2",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "5ab61c9fba72",
     "text": "Rides for Kids 40 to 43 Inches",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "9f0a8841cb1e",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "20c738b7f57c",
     "text": "At 40 inches, three rides open up:",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "883d15625184",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "9ba3576e7f3c",
     "text": "Test Track",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "cd0f23f52d9f",
     "text": " — a future-of-cars ride that ends with what Disney calls a high-speed race. It's about speed rather than big drops.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ],
   "listItem": "bullet",
   "level": 1
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "6c23f4ffc523",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "5c847cbaf65b",
     "text": "Soarin' Across America",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "9d3f20e71bc7",
     "text": " — a simulated flight in front of an 80-foot dome screen, with scents and what Disney calls graceful motion.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ],
   "listItem": "bullet",
   "level": 1
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "8ae6ea692705",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "ca432142a900",
     "text": "Mission: SPACE (Green)",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "6335e37b08b6",
     "text": " — the gentler orbit-of-Earth version of this simulator. It still feels intense for some kids, so try it before the Orange side.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ],
   "listItem": "bullet",
   "level": 1
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "af2ab0594ee2",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "01fc24ac2b6c",
     "text": "At 42 inches, ",
     "marks": []
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "ca440215ee68",
     "text": "Guardians of the Galaxy: Cosmic Rewind",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "4c42ada24459",
     "text": " opens. It's a fully enclosed roller coaster whose cars rotate 360 degrees, with a reverse launch. It's the park's biggest coaster, so check your child's comfort with coasters first.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "afb22bc94018",
   "style": "h2",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "1e69a86e0890",
     "text": "Rides for Kids 44 Inches and Up",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "15deedac9f2f",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "f9df8b3e2b96",
     "text": "At 44 inches, kids can add ",
     "marks": []
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "b53c0c370458",
     "text": "Mission: SPACE (Orange)",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "8c5bf16deb84",
     "text": ", the Mars mission, which Disney says uses a centrifuge that spins and tilts to simulate launch G-forces. Disney calls it the more intense option, and it's fine to skip.",
     "marks": []
