   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "c2d797d45d4a",
     "text": "Kids 40\" and up can add Test Track and Soarin', and 42\"+ can add Guardians, ideally with Lightning Lane or at quieter times. Check current Lightning Lane options and prices in the My Disney Experience app, since they vary by date. Picking dates? Our ",
