  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "e1330c22b12a",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "2a686609efc1",
     "text": "EPCOT involves a lot of walking, and Orlando can stay warm into fall. Plan shade and water breaks, bring refillable bottles, and use indoor rides like Spaceship Earth and The Seas to cool off. If a child shows signs of heat illness, get help from park First Aid or a doctor — Disney lists First Aid in every Walt Disney World theme park.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
